                        "form": "fastefoude"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "12c2bf70-176c-33ca-b4dd-e9c1627c9905",
                        "entry_id": "351f78f8-ac4f-3ae4-9c1a-f4a38f853b51",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Restauration rapide où le but est de faire gagner du temps au client."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1267eb8e-848f-4f8b-bb9b-5a0c74318803",
                                "sense_id": "12c2bf70-176c-33ca-b4dd-e9c1627c9905",
                                "text": "Le fast-food est un plaisir pervers. Une jouissance intellectuelle d’abord : la volupté de se vautrer dans le politiquement incorrect."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cb269711-3c4f-498b-bb54-11283a855c75",
                                "sense_id": "12c2bf70-176c-33ca-b4dd-e9c1627c9905",
                                "text": "Le fast-food halal est historiquement dominé de la tête et des épaules par les kebabs, ces petits points de vente dans lesquels les consommateurs de viande halal achètent les « döner kebabs » (« grillade tournante »), ce sandwich d'origine turque garni de viande de veau, de dinde ou de poulet."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5a43cdff-c8c9-4570-aa96-e6b9a577b3dd",
                                "sense_id": "12c2bf70-176c-33ca-b4dd-e9c1627c9905",
                                "text": "En raison de leurs propriétés hydro- et oléophobes, ces composés sont utilisés dans une grande variété d’articles du quotidien, depuis les poêles antiadhésives jusqu’aux emballages de fast-food."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "85d2e9dd-39a5-3eb2-8ab1-66c764333cd3",
                        "entry_id": "351f78f8-ac4f-3ae4-9c1a-f4a38f853b51",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Restaurant où le client est servi très rapidement."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c148934d-451c-4dbc-a23c-78760eb6b8e8",
                                "sense_id": "85d2e9dd-39a5-3eb2-8ab1-66c764333cd3",
                                "text": "Il s’agit d'une organisation activiste, qui multiplie les opérations spectaculaires : commandos contre des fast-food halals, « apéros saucisson-pinard », ou manifestations musclées."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "294a0aee-ef60-486b-b346-8cf6e0bae4a8",
                                "sense_id": "85d2e9dd-39a5-3eb2-8ab1-66c764333cd3",
                                "text": "Les adresses gourmandes connaissent le même phénomène, les brasseries, salons de thé, cafés-restaurants côtoient les fast-food, et les restaurants de cuisine étrangère font leur apparition."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9aed8af2-be1c-478d-ae15-8e4fef19f325",
                        "source_entry_id": "351f78f8-ac4f-3ae4-9c1a-f4a38f853b51",
                        "target_lang_word": "Fastfood",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Fastfood",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "643b894d-f549-362d-8c45-64ec13d904c8",
                                        "entry_id": "43bd2bf2-033c-3000-9244-5b0bb53b015f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Gastronomie, Essen, das schnell zubereitet, serviert und verzehrt wird"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "no-plural"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5fa3b3d9-0a38-45fa-ba9f-2ee838a57411",
                                                "sense_id": "643b894d-f549-362d-8c45-64ec13d904c8",
                                                "text": "„Beinahe alles schmeckt dort so herausragend, dass ein mit Fastfood aufgewachsener Ausländer einen Kulturschock bekommt, wenn er mit der kaukasischen Küche in Berührung kommt.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "540e5cf3-9fb5-40ae-a069-727ce293ba0a",
                                                "sense_id": "643b894d-f549-362d-8c45-64ec13d904c8",
                                                "text": "„Überhaupt ist Fastfood das wichtigste Essen der Isländer.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fe70d982-c204-4f3d-a95c-5eabcd36b6c2",
                                                "sense_id": "643b894d-f549-362d-8c45-64ec13d904c8",
                                                "text": "„Die Hanse hatte sogar beliebtes Fastfood à la McDonald's im Angebot: den Stockfisch.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0b324463-2630-3e11-a13f-5617dff6c4d5",
                                        "entry_id": "43bd2bf2-033c-3000-9244-5b0bb53b015f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Restaurant, in welchem Fastfood¹ serviert wird"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "dea759df-510e-4a0d-89dd-a1d1a4bb52fc",
                        "source_entry_id": "351f78f8-ac4f-3ae4-9c1a-f4a38f853b51",
                        "target_lang_word": "Schnellkost",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Schnellkost",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1e1a98b0-890f-3995-a295-4e1ae47e5115",
                                        "entry_id": "cc560a31-8f35-303d-8aea-b64c90e61554",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Gericht, das zügig zubereitet, serviert und verzehrt wird"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "rare"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ff6382b0-94ee-43a2-af46-b3c977042ee8",
                                                "sense_id": "1e1a98b0-890f-3995-a295-4e1ae47e5115",
                                                "text": "Besonders Jugendliche schätzen Schnellkost."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e08276d9-6842-45de-8f16-b709a67dc4ee",
                                                "sense_id": "1e1a98b0-890f-3995-a295-4e1ae47e5115",
                                                "text": "„Wem das nicht genügt, der hat ganz in der Nähe des Hotels die Wahl zwischen amerikanischer Schnellkost und bayerisch-bürgerlichem Essen im Restaurant“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0fc3b2c1-0f15-4425-9ed4-e15b044f1c6a",
                                                "sense_id": "1e1a98b0-890f-3995-a295-4e1ae47e5115",
                                                "text": "„Im Zeitalter tief gekühlter Schnellkost gilt Dobribans Leidenschaft der Langsamkeit.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "261f6249-ed02-496d-a393-4497ce6905a0",
                                                "sense_id": "1e1a98b0-890f-3995-a295-4e1ae47e5115",
                                                "text": "„Drive-In-Schalter für amerikanische Schnellkost. Das kennen wir ja. Aber für die Abgabe von Briefen?! Probieren werd’ ich es demnächst bestimmt.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3ae17434-9205-4cbd-8392-0ef2a7b37500",
                                                "sense_id": "1e1a98b0-890f-3995-a295-4e1ae47e5115",
                                                "text": "„Darüber hinaus werden Pilotprojekte wie die Ausschank-Kette \"Prost Mahlzeit\" oder die Schnellkost-Unternehmung \"etcetera\" gestartet“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "26f51ce1-677a-427b-87dc-2472b99484b4",
                                                "sense_id": "1e1a98b0-890f-3995-a295-4e1ae47e5115",
                                                "text": "„Daß die Münchner Schnellkost in der Matchbewertung \"Einer wird gewinnen\" knapp hinter dem TiB punktete, macht Appetit auf das Rückspiel“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "81d7e5b8-12df-4e2c-820f-8fa137ff7002",
                        "source_entry_id": "351f78f8-ac4f-3ae4-9c1a-f4a38f853b51",
                        "target_lang_word": "Schnellgaststätte",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d2deb3db-e2b5-4934-b259-ca5c93453522",
                        "source_entry_id": "351f78f8-ac4f-3ae4-9c1a-f4a38f853b51",
                        "target_lang_word": "fast food",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "fast food",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6eff10b2-40b5-3411-8a87-903cdb8e9d4d",
                                        "entry_id": "1a74869c-36ca-3d1a-81d7-762c02b35a46",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Food that is served quickly, often standardized and pre-prepared."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "33d4016e-4b32-3b13-9395-7f295402a7a7",
                                        "entry_id": "1a74869c-36ca-3d1a-81d7-762c02b35a46",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A type of food that is quickly made, but of low nutritional value; junk food."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4e5048e8-eab0-416c-a9dd-f29c2b193995",
                                                "sense_id": "33d4016e-4b32-3b13-9395-7f295402a7a7",
                                                "text": "In the course of the last decade, it has become the dominant “fast-food” franchise in America—and it is now spreading abroad, carrying its gospel of machine technology wedded to cheap hamburgers wherever it can find a mouth-hold, and converting anyone it can to the glories of junk food"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dd927394-ed89-4b9d-a00d-bc6af34b1c7d",
                                                "sense_id": "33d4016e-4b32-3b13-9395-7f295402a7a7",
                                                "text": "Everyone loves some junk food some of the time. That's why there are more than 140,000 fast food restaurants in the U.S."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3b186812-f517-4b75-a9e5-54c308adad89",
                                                "sense_id": "33d4016e-4b32-3b13-9395-7f295402a7a7",
                                                "text": "In high schools with open campuses, students leave at lunchtime to buy fast food elsewhere. Since leaving school is unsafe, schools are opting to serve less nutritious foods so the students stay on campus. For example, many schools have invited junk food franchises into their cafeterias, including Subway, Taco Bell, and Domino's."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "94bd5bb4-c4d6-49cb-88d8-b4d9a6967f33",
                                                "sense_id": "33d4016e-4b32-3b13-9395-7f295402a7a7",
                                                "text": "Disney even chose to stop licensing its film characters for McDonald’s Happy Meals, citing the link between fast food and childhood obesity."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4dfaa7ad-0118-40f0-96a5-17a9346c4066",
                                                "sense_id": "33d4016e-4b32-3b13-9395-7f295402a7a7",
                                                "text": "Junk food companies spent billions of advertising dollars in 2017 targeting black and Hispanic kids, a new study has revealed. / Television ads for fast food, sugary drinks and fatty or salty snacks are almost exclusively targeted to minority youth, the report, supported by the Robert Wood Johnson Foundation, found."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fe2b130b-e46e-3780-bb6d-c62296caeaf0",
                                        "entry_id": "1a74869c-36ca-3d1a-81d7-762c02b35a46",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Anything standardized, quickly available, and inexpensive, often, of low value."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "78b8e410-4be0-4cab-be85-6bd4f4a366a8",
                                                "sense_id": "fe2b130b-e46e-3780-bb6d-c62296caeaf0",
                                                "text": "The best evidence is that Sandals, the fast-food king of island weddings, now markets the term weddingmoons."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9d40c229-8f9c-4a2d-a79b-d706ce9ccc62",
                                                "sense_id": "fe2b130b-e46e-3780-bb6d-c62296caeaf0",
                                                "text": "Guys are good for two things: 1) help when you need to move something heavy, and 2) fast-food sex where you always know what's on the menu and, with a little work, you can supersize it"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eede2e98-f6c8-4dc3-80f9-f378ca9474dd",
                                                "sense_id": "fe2b130b-e46e-3780-bb6d-c62296caeaf0",
                                                "text": "Outside, the drive-in crowd is heading back into the Sturm und Drang of city traffic and a fast-food world"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
